# A whitelist: the repo carries only what the game and its deploy need, everything else stays local.
# The 07 asset tree lives in R2 (https://assets.vla.dev), so out/ is never here. Docs (*.md), build tools (tools/,
# *.mjs, *.csv), play-local.cmd, .claude/ and .wrangler/ are all skipped by the first line.
# A new file the game loads must be listed below, or it silently never reaches GitHub (and so never deploys).
/*

# the deploy: Worker, its config, the static-asset headers and exclusions
!/.gitignore
!/.assetsignore
!/_headers
!/wrangler.toml
!/src/
/src/*
!/src/worker.js

# the page and its scripts (load order is in index.html)
!/index.html
!/style.css
!/game.js
!/icons07.js
!/data07.js
!/data07-stats.js
!/data07-npcstats.js
!/data07-items.js
!/osrs.js
!/map07.js
!/osui.js

# the few files the game still fetches from this folder
!/assets/
/assets/*
!/assets/map07/
!/assets/sound/
!/assets/i07/
!/assets/c07/
